ADDITIONAL ACCEPTABLE USE NOTICE

This software is intended exclusively for:

  (a) DEFENSIVE SECURITY AUDIT of computer systems owned by the user, or
      systems for which the user has explicit written authorization to
      perform security testing.

  (b) EDUCATIONAL AND RESEARCH purposes related to credential storage,
      cryptographic protections, and infostealer threat models.

USE OF THIS SOFTWARE TO ACCESS, EXTRACT, OR PROCESS CREDENTIALS FROM SYSTEMS
THE USER DOES NOT OWN OR DOES NOT HAVE EXPLICIT AUTHORIZATION TO AUDIT IS
PROHIBITED AND MAY VIOLATE LOCAL, NATIONAL, AND INTERNATIONAL LAWS, INCLUDING
